#. module: social_media_advertising
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_media_advertising.social_advertising_ad_view_form
msgid ""
"This deletes the ad and its history in Odoo: cost, impressions, clicks and "
"the window they cover. Nothing is deleted on the social media, which no "
"longer serves this ad anyway. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina el anuncio y su histórico en Odoo: coste, impresiones, clics y "
"el periodo que abarcan. No se elimina nada en la red social, que de todos "
"modos ya no sirve este anuncio. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

#. module: social_media_advertising
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_media_advertising.social_advertising_ad_view_form
msgid ""
"This deletes the ad on the social media and cannot be undone. An ad that is "
"already being served is not deleted right away: the social media only takes "
"the request and processes it afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina el anuncio en la red social y no se puede deshacer. Un anuncio "
"que ya se está sirviendo no se elimina de inmediato: la red social solo "
"recoge la solicitud y la procesa después."

