"red social."

#. module: social_media_advertising
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:social_media_advertising.field_social_advertising_ad__advertising_account_is_current
msgid ""
"Whether the advertising account this ad belongs to is the one the social "
"media account works with right now. Ads of the other advertising accounts "
"are kept as they were last synchronized."
msgstr ""
"Indica si la cuenta publicitaria a la que pertenece este anuncio es aquella "
"con la que trabaja ahora mismo la cuenta de la red social. Los anuncios de "
